{
  "name": "Creator OS - Ingestão de Eventos no Supabase",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "creator-events",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0f3c37a0-6f61-4f4a-a001-creatorwebhook01",
      "name": "Webhook de Eventos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-520, 220],
      "webhookId": "creator-os-event-ingest"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $json.body ?? $json;\n\nif (!input.event_name) {\n  throw new Error('event_name é obrigatório');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  event_name: input.event_name,\n  creator_id: input.creator_id ?? null,\n  contact_id: input.contact_id ?? null,\n  campaign_id: input.campaign_id ?? null,\n  channel: input.channel ?? null,\n  source: input.source ?? null,\n  click_id: input.click_id ?? null,\n  value: input.value ?? null,\n  currency: input.currency ?? null,\n  properties: input.properties ?? {},\n  occurred_at: input.occurred_at ?? new Date().toISOString()\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "f2836a2b-99d6-4212-a002-normalizeevent1",
      "name": "Normalizar Evento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-280, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL + '/rest/v1/events' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}"},
            {"name": "Authorization", "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}"},
            {"name": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation"}
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "body": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c81a8e61-9660-4ad0-a003-writeevent001",
      "name": "Gravar Evento no Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-20, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, event: $json }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e563f4c9-c61b-40f2-a004-response0001",
      "name": "Responder OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [240, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ingestão de eventos do Creator OS\nEnvie para este webhook eventos normalizados vindos do Telegram, Fanvue, tracking social ou seus próprios serviços.\n\nObrigatório: `event_name`.\n\nConfigure `SUPABASE_URL` e `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` no ambiente do n8n. O schema de destino está em `08-memory-crm/schema.sql`.\n\nExemplos de eventos: `lead_created`, `message_received`, `cta_clicked`, `checkout_started`, `purchase`, `renewal`, `churn`, `reengaged`.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 430
      },
